{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f978b2fb85eb78324211ea8cc6f4ee4e83e762da2e43cabe7a9d65d1ed8bb1cf","ja":"ふたりの憧れサンセット","zh":"两人的憧憬夕阳","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e0215f976dffb05f41da65e3c66b0d3c1f16f07173f9cb95305b48bdd08a49d5","ja":"亜利沙と歩の収録は終了し、\nバラエティ番組のオンエア当日……","zh":"亚利沙和步的录制已经结束，\n到了综艺节目播出的当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8bf5c23161066ffdf880f13c2de419eeda63894344c8a1c0a5ef1f5a2f46f756","ja":"い、いよいよ、次がありさの番です……。","zh":"马、马上，下一个就轮到亚利沙了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c9941e7b04c0658c89f623f01c5c5af5711233819e1bfb2331194ce91e75f57f","ja":"ど、どうしてあなたがこんなところに……\nえっ、ありさのハンカチを届けてくれたんですか！？","zh":"怎、你怎么会在这里……\n咦，你是来把手帕送还给亚利沙的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fe49647e7d425634ed48ccb95fa160357e03d55fc09e8ccd285349fb3fe32a14","ja":"ありがとうございます……！　あ、あの……\nよ、よかったらお礼に夕陽が見えるカフェでも……。","zh":"非常感谢您……！那、那个……\n要、要是您不介意的话，作为答谢，要不要去能看见夕阳的咖啡厅……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"35305de9cc3c2d3145184e51f099f2e49a0adfbef8a2ff1fdcf14752460bcbdd","ja":"えっ、ここで終わり！？　ハンカチを拾ってくれた\nアイドルと、カフェに行くんじゃなかったの？","zh":"哎，这就结束了吗！？不是说好要和捡到手帕的\n偶像一起去咖啡厅的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e8a5713d30d32ce5f9771735808e6799536cac433dbc4b40f81b2aae51ce890c","ja":"そ、それが、尺の都合でナシになっちゃいまして……。\nうう、アイドルちゃんとのデートプランが～！","zh":"那、那个，因为时长原因给取消了……。\n呜呜，和小偶像的约会计划啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e8374dc62899c14d081d65fa17b6b6ad2f5df85ed5b81febfed569f8d37f7ad4","ja":"でも、そういうところも亜利沙っぽくて、\nミキ的には、面白かったって思うな☆","zh":"不过，这种地方也很有亚利沙的风格，\n美希觉得挺有趣的呢☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f35294d459ff13ff4a50330119066722a69033795878f2189fce9a2e9087e6d0","ja":"そ、そうなのかな……あ！\nこの次はアタシか！","zh":"是、是那样吗……啊！\n下一个轮到我了吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"1a2963ddc02e0840f33e40cfe0a8e522b80da367549d1035fade4152c75e886b","ja":"もしかしてアナタは……\nあの伝説のストリートダンサー！？","zh":"难道你就是……\n那位传说的街舞舞者！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"7ee0e0bc9deb28e465e3c59bf7928185f44ec26eee3dd13163553f0826733c35","ja":"アタシの力が知りたい？　……ふっ、わかったよ！\nじゃあ今から陽が落ちるまで、ダンスバトルだっ！","zh":"想见识我的实力？……哼，我知道了！\n那从现在开始直到太阳下山，来进行斗舞吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"36a6e3498ecdd4dbdcaa4a300f1094eb32347ddd8110b78ad2b76480fa5567bd","ja":"ダンスすっごく気合い入ってたね。\n歩、かっこよかったの☆","zh":"跳舞超级有干劲呢。\n步，帅呆了哦☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"bd77ad5d5cb4eaad6c39ab5102d9c72c4c0eff60d7542ab4d8db25d80a765772","ja":"えへへ♪　しかもこれが縁でさ、今度本当に\nダンサーさんを紹介してもらえることになったんだ！","zh":"嘿嘿♪　而且借着这个机会，\n下次真的要给我介绍舞者了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"cede44cf178ba61d4d299000705aabe18feaf52231390da30ee461b34f8dc0bb","ja":"すごいです！　おめでとうございます、歩ちゃん！\n憧れのシチュエーションが叶えられて……。","zh":"太厉害了！恭喜你，步！\n憧憬的场景终于实现了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"4e20e655694cc1492c2cd0a36b6ec332f7adf0916349562713c158e69643a876","ja":"ありさは、カフェの撮影がなくなって\n残念でしたが……。","zh":"亚利沙虽然觉得咖啡厅的拍摄取消了\n很可惜就是了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"fef41a7d7a0aba5f0f0653b517981d55b96074b88c6ca6a560accdda99491019","ja":"じゃあ、今から3人で\n亜利沙の行きたいカフェに行ってみる？","zh":"那我们现在3个人\n一起去亚利沙想去的咖啡厅看看吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"6cc2c1a7d77bf899455db4551dec7376ddd60b74799407849a9cfce7f956fbc8","ja":"はっ！　美希ちゃんと歩ちゃんと一緒なら……\nありさも憧れのシチュエーションが叶います！","zh":"啊！　要是和美希还有步在一起的话……\n亚利沙也能实现梦寐以求的场景了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1148.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"b01677d97f5301cc345ff698312e79ba820d81b3e2c715af6e75f0d5d3302894","ja":"ふおおおお～っ！　ありさ、やりたいこと\nアピールしてよかったです～～～！","zh":"哇啊啊啊～！　亚利沙有把想做的事\n展现出来真是太好了～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
